{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，港島綫整體行車時間一度受阻，至約10時半恢復正常。</p>\n<p>在金鐘站往柴灣方向月台迫滿候車人士，站內屏幕顯示港島綫服務受阻。</p>\n<p>港鐵於約早上8時45分指，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，港島綫整體行車一度需要額外5至8分鐘。至約10時半陸續恢復正常。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:04:34.164489+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:45:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:58:06.767299+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:58:06.767299+00:00","content_hash":"31102c5bf4ae9e0e0a6f4e2c43afc7feb9f8cfd00e281446707f5f91f7a12c7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}